A||||8||86SE||Nightmares!||||11||
Z||000000||86SE||08-14-2000||03:25 AM||||Seems everynight I dream about my Fiero.  Most of them very bad dreams, nightmares.  Like the other night, I was driving through town in my bright yellow Fiero and some guy in a crappy pickup comes roaring around the corner and hit the Fiero.  I get out and see large scratches in the paint, now i'm complaining about the scratches in my new paint.  Then I look towards the rear and see that my notchback piece has a very large chunk missing and my rear bumper cover is clear across the street!  I was very sad...and upset.  And to top it all off, they guy in the pickup was complaing about the dent in his bumper!<P>I woke up and was still bummin, then remembered it was just a dream.........<P>I have lots of dreams where the Fiero gets totaled, and every time I wake up pissed. weird<P>And sometimes I dream about haveing a garage full of Fieros and Hummers and Limos and Ferraris.  When I wake up I even go out to my garage to check if they are still there.........im always dissappointed when I get there.<P>And no, im not on crack.<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Stering wheel<BR>Gas AND brake petals<BR>**Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention**||||reg||11
Z||000001||Monkeyman||08-14-2000||03:50 AM||||I've had the same nightmare for years, but it's not Fiero related.  Scares the sh** out of me.  Wakes me up in a cold sweat.||||reg||1
Z||000002||86SE||08-14-2000||04:29 AM||||You know whats weird, You can't die in your dreams!  I wake up everytime just before I die or get killed......usually at the same time of afternoon too...<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Stering wheel<BR>Gas AND brake petals<BR>**Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention**||||reg||1
Z||000003||Monkeyman||08-14-2000||05:34 AM||||Supposedly, if you die in your dream, you die in real life, too.  I'm not too sure about that, though, 'cause I sort of die in my nightmares.  At least that's the way it looks.||||reg||1
Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||08-14-2000||02:11 PM||||this should probably be in the O/T section ya know...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I have a few comments on dreams, but they're not Fiero related.. well, one is.. anyone experience lucid dreams? (that's where you're aware of the fact that you're dreaming, and can change things/events/places..)<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
Z||000005||Cliff Pennock||08-14-2000||03:05 PM||||Hmmmm. I thought I was the only one dreaming about my Fiero!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I usually dream one of two things: that I get to my car and everything is stolen from it (including all the bodyplates) or that my brakes fail - but only when driving backwards (there must be some deep psychological meaning to this - like don't eat pizza at 2am!).||||reg||1
Z||000006||86SE||08-14-2000||03:38 PM||||I had dreams of the Fiero where the body panels were taken off too!  Couple of times it got rolled on its side down a hill.  It blew up a few times.....but its always still parked in my garage when I wake up.<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Stering wheel<BR>Gas AND brake petals<BR>**Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention**||||reg||10
Z||000007||HugGRRRFiero||08-14-2000||03:41 PM||||   The best are the dreams where you wake up and everything seemed (or seems) so real.  I always see Jim Morrison and a half naked indian guy in some of my dreams...  does anybody else?  Oh, and they say to me that I must build a Fiero or put on a rock concert and they will come?<P>   I'm wondering if my Fiero still has nightmares from all the past abuse it's had from careless owners?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">   <BR>   <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A>  <p>[This message has been edited by HugGRRRFiero (edited 08-14-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000008||Pontiaddict||08-14-2000||04:31 PM||||I had a nightmare about my Fiero once.<BR>I was in my high school parking lot and it was winter. I was sitting in a friends Ford Ranger. All of the sudden, another friend backs into the parking spot next to me, driving his '79 Bronco. The one being occupied by my Fiero! He backs up slowly... stops. Okay maybe he's just joking. Backs up more, stops. This isn't funny. Backs up more... stops. Okay any further and he's gonna get the crap kicked out of him. Backs up.... he doesn't stop this time. CRRRRRAAAACK!!!!!! In 1/100th of a second, I'm out of the Ranger and at the door of his truck going "#&^$&*$^@#&*$^@#&*^$&*@!!!!!!!!"<P>Oh crap, that wasn't a dream. Was still a nightmare though.||||reg||1
